// w08_body_escape.mini - my own REJECTED example: a body-local name used
// after the loop. (inputs/outside.mini does the same with the counter.)
//
// Try:  minic lower w08/w08_body_escape.mini -> works, exit 0: lowering only
//         rearranges the tree
//       minic check w08/w08_body_escape.mini ->
//         "w08/w08_body_escape.mini:3:9: resolve: unknown variable 'last'"
//         exit 1, nothing printed
//
// Before the edit: "internal: TODO WEEK08 ...", exit 70 (lowering fails
// before the resolver is ever reached).
//
// last is declared inside the original body block, which is closed before
// the outer block is, so print last finds no binding.
